{"4148510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Area58", "steam_appid": 4148510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Enter a hostile, unpredictable environment where every decision carries weight.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">AREA58 is a co-op horror experience for 1-6 players, built around tension and the fear of losing control. What begins as a routine operation quickly turns into something far more dangerous, forcing players to adapt, stay alert, and survive under constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/9df064e8c61a10d5a131f9c809492776.poster.avif?t=1772889177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/9df064e8c61a10d5a131f9c809492776.webm?t=1772889177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/9df064e8c61a10d5a131f9c809492776.mp4?t=1772889177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>No run feels completely safe.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Plans fall apart. Communication breaks down.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>And the deeper you go, the less certain everything becomes.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work carefully, manage the growing chaos, and keep moving forward while the situation around you gets worse by the minute. In AREA58, survival is never guaranteed and hesitation can be just as deadly as whatever is waiting ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/3b1744e53b8d93d58ee326b7b5655231.poster.avif?t=1772889177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/3b1744e53b8d93d58ee326b7b5655231.webm?t=1772889177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/3b1744e53b8d93d58ee326b7b5655231.mp4?t=1772889177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you make it out, it will not be because you were ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It will be because you endured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Do your job. Earn their trust. Do whatever it takes to escape.</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Enter a hostile, unpredictable environment where every decision carries weight.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">AREA58 is a co-op horror experience for 1-6 players, built around tension and the fear of losing control. What begins as a routine operation quickly turns into something far more dangerous, forcing players to adapt, stay alert, and survive under constant pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/9df064e8c61a10d5a131f9c809492776.poster.avif?t=1772889177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/9df064e8c61a10d5a131f9c809492776.webm?t=1772889177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/9df064e8c61a10d5a131f9c809492776.mp4?t=1772889177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>No run feels completely safe.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Plans fall apart. Communication breaks down.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>And the deeper you go, the less certain everything becomes.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work carefully, manage the growing chaos, and keep moving forward while the situation around you gets worse by the minute. In AREA58, survival is never guaranteed and hesitation can be just as deadly as whatever is waiting ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/3b1744e53b8d93d58ee326b7b5655231.poster.avif?t=1772889177\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/3b1744e53b8d93d58ee326b7b5655231.webm?t=1772889177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/extras/3b1744e53b8d93d58ee326b7b5655231.mp4?t=1772889177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you make it out, it will not be because you were ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It will be because you endured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Do your job. Earn their trust. Do whatever it takes to escape.</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "AREA58 is a 1-6 player online co-op first-person horror stealth-escape game where you must complete assigned tasks each round on time but your hidden goal is to plan your escape without raising suspicion while doing so.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/dfe7785b3130553995ab4d962b0cb92c39715fe6/header.jpg?t=1772889177", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/c023b41890d827042c20aa1c1d15aab4d6e96b0d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772889177", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148510/c023b41890d827042c20aa1c1d15aab4d6e96b0d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772889177", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD RX 480 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<stro